| cambios de lado | 2 | 2 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| ropa | 3 | 3 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| ropa + clic | 289 | 286 | 3 | 0 | 82 | 66 |
| ropa y cambios de lado | 36 | 27 | 9 | 0 | 2 | 0 |
